Multiplies the scheduler's value of prompt work by FLARE_PREFILL_PRIORITY (unset or invalid means 1.0, upstream's
pricing), so a new turn's prompt outbids decode rounds sooner. Same change as ../flare-prefill-priority.patch,
regenerated for the newer file (upstream changed only its licence header).

Applies to NVIDIA/hyperflare-inference at 8a887202a0ee55d456ddcf7510161e22865505bc. The patched file is part of
Hyperflare's Helios and remains under the Apache License 2.0.

